 la franja inmediatamente inferior, lo esperable serían 3,4 contratos. La razón entre observados y esperados es 9,4, con un intervalo de confianza del 95 % de 5,1 a 18,1. El contrato [1], de 14.850 euros, se adjudicó en junio de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: la acumulación de importes junto al límite es un indicador estadístico. No prueba que se haya partido ningún contrato ni que alguien haya actuado mal; puede deberse a precios de mercado, a presupuestos cerrados o a necesidades distintas.\nQué se puede revisar: en los expedientes enlazados, qué se contrató en cada caso y en qué fechas, y si varios contratos atienden una misma necesidad que pudo contratarse de una vez.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 32 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 3.4 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 9.4, with a 95% confidence interval of 5.1 to 18.1. December accounts for 3% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 3% of all its services and supplies contracts. The contracts just under the limit are spread across 28 different awardees. Contract [1], for 14,850 euros, was awarded in June 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The high ratio of contracts just under the limit does not prove improper actions. It could reflect market pricing or budget constraints. The data is a statistical trend, not evidence of wrongdoing.\nWhat can be checked: Check the contracts' dates and awardees to see if multiple contracts serve the same purpose. Review the specific services purchased to ensure they align with the body's needs. Contract [1] shows a single low-value award, which may be legitimate.","origen_es":"plantilla","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["RG6g9nZd6GxJ8Trn0ZPzLw%3D%3D","PdyvvlFHwA3CfVQHDepjGQ%3D%3D","asyl58cz5%2F9%2FR5QFTlaM4A%3D%3D"],"gen